<title>MEXICO: Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate rises to 25.775 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate rises to 25.775 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate rose by 0.225 percentage points to 25.775 percent on Wednesday, from 25.55 percent on Tuesday, the Mexican Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>THE TIIP fell 0.3249 percentage points to 25.7471 percent on Wednesday from 26.072 percent the week before.</p>
<p>The TIIE is a market-weighted average interbank rate that is replacing the TIIP, an average interbank rate.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom 525 7289558</p>
